  revisitTitle: One track per musician
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  pages:
  - 'See the song panel? Every musician gets their own track there: drums set the
    pulse, keys build the world, bass holds it together, voice is what sticks in
    your head. Each composition card touches the track of whoever plays it.'
